From: nuubOS Project <nuubos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] mmc: sunxi: add H616 eMMC controller configuration

The H616 MMC2 controller uses the eMMC variant of the controller but
requires DATA0 masking while updating the card clock.

Without SDXC_MASK_DATA0, a removable SD card connected to MMC2 can
cause the UPCLK_ONLY command issued during runtime resume to time out
when the card is inserted after the controller has runtime-suspended.

Add a dedicated H616 eMMC configuration which preserves the A100 eMMC
descriptor layout while enabling DATA0 masking. This fixes reliable
hot insertion on the H700-based Anbernic RG35XX Pro without changing
the generic A100 eMMC configuration.

Signed-off-by: nuubOS Project <nuubos@localhost>
---
 drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
--- a/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
+++ b/drivers/mmc/host/sunxi-mmc.c
@@ -1198,6 +1198,15 @@ static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun50i_h616_cfg = {
 	.needs_new_timings = true,
 };
 
+static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun50i_h616_emmc_cfg = {
+	.idma_des_size_bits = 13,
+	.idma_des_shift = 2,
+	.clk_delays = NULL,
+	.can_calibrate = true,
+	.mask_data0 = true,
+	.needs_new_timings = true,
+};
+
 static const struct sunxi_mmc_cfg sun50i_a100_emmc_cfg = {
 	.idma_des_size_bits = 13,
 	.idma_des_shift = 2,
@@ -1218,4 +1227,5 @@ static const struct of_device_id sunxi_mmc_of_match[] = {
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-a100-mmc", .data = &sun20i_d1_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-a100-emmc", .data = &sun50i_a100_emmc_cfg },
+	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-emmc", .data = &sun50i_h616_emmc_cfg },
 	{ .compatible = "allwinner,sun50i-h616-mmc", .data = &sun50i_h616_cfg },
 	{ /* sentinel */ }
